! TRSTEP.DBG - STEP through code the program traces (part A). Is the
! trace of each instruction a STEP runs the program's (TCOUNT goes up)
! or the debugger's? Does T stay set after each step?
SET STEP INSTRUCTION
SET BREAK A2
GO
EXAMINE PSL
EXAMINE TCOUNT
STEP
EXAMINE PSL
EXAMINE TCOUNT
STEP
EXAMINE PSL
EXAMINE TCOUNT
STEP
EXAMINE TCOUNT
STEP
EXAMINE TCOUNT
STEP
EXAMINE PSL
EXAMINE TCOUNT
STEP
EXAMINE PSL
EXAMINE TCOUNT
GO
